   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n<div>\r\n<div><font face=\"georgia\" size=\"2\"><div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">there are the last 2 seats for the upcoming Physalia online course, <strong>R/Bioconductor for Mass Spectrometry and Proteomics</strong>, taking place online from <strong>March 17-19</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Course website: <a style=\"color:rgb(0,102,204);text-decoration:none;outline:none\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230441746000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nSjLhOTqKN7-STK6qpwL7\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/</a> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">This\r\n hands-on course will guide you through the analysis of mass \r\nspectrometry (MS) data using R and Bioconductor. Learn how to handle raw\r\n MS data, identify and quantify proteins, and perform statistical \r\nanalysis for proteomics research.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">A\r\n basic working knowledge of R (data frames, vectors, syntax) is \r\nrequired. Familiarity with MS or Bioconductor is helpful but not \r\nessential, as we provide a comprehensive introduction.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">For the full list of our courses and workshops, please visit: <a style=\"color:rgb(0,102,204);text-decoration:none;outline:none;font-family:georgia;font-size:13.3333px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/course58/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793230441746000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nSjLhOTqKN7-STK6qpwL7\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spaci